      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Advanced mechanical systems can expose materials to combined high temperature and high stress.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::chunk::001::introduction::c389c7efcd",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::001::introduction::73adf78dd5",
        "PMC7513042::chunk::001::introduction::f13797f6f6"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Engineered interfacial bonding will mitigate debonding or phase separation in the proposed composite.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Robust interfacial bonding will enable effective load transfer and sustained lubrication.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The layered structure of Ti3SiC2 permits easy shear between its planes.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interplanar shear in Ti3SiC2 provides inherent lubricity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Ti3SiC2 is well bonded to the ceramic, it can reduce friction while the ceramic retains its load-bearing function.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified composite will have significantly lower friction coefficients than the unmodified ceramic.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified composite will have lower wear rates than the unmodified ceramic.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified composite will retain mechanical strength comparable to that of the unmodified ceramic at high temperature.",
